graph TD
    User([User/Web Browser])
    Frontend[Frontend Container\nReact / Nginx]
    Backend[Backend Container\nFastAPI Server]
    MediaMTX[MediaMTX Container\nRTSP/WebRTC Server]
    Inference[Inference Container\nPyTorch / TorchScript]
    Redis[(Redis Pub/Sub\nMessage Broker)]
    TimescaleDB[(TimescaleDB\nPostgreSQL 15)]
    Cameras((IP Cameras\nRTSP Streams))

    User <-->|HTTP/REST| Frontend
    Frontend <-->|API Calls| Backend
    Frontend <-->|WebRTC Stream| MediaMTX
    
    Cameras -->|RTSP Feed| MediaMTX
    MediaMTX -->|RTSP Feed| Backend
    
    Backend -->|Push Image Frames| Redis
    Redis -->|Consume Frames| Inference
    Inference -->|Push Detections| Redis
    Redis -->|Consume Detections| Backend
    
    Backend <-->|CRUD & Events| TimescaleDB
